fighter: credits and licences

Everything in this game is made by its own code (tools/ and the C sources): the characters, the stages, the
textures, the sounds and the music. Nothing is downloaded.
  tools/make-textures.mjs, texlib.mjs   every PBR texture set (albedo, normal, occlusion-roughness-metal, emissive)
  tools/make-characters.mjs, charmesh.mjs   the four fighters and the crowd (skinned glb files)
  tools/make-world.mjs, mesher.mjs, gltf-writer.mjs   the three stage backgrounds
The character, texture and glTF tools and secondary.c started as copies of the brawler game's in this repository
(same authors, same licence) and were adapted here.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence files shipped beside them in assets/fonts):
